          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Snipaste preferences (hotkeys, screenshot behavior, UI settings) from config.ini. Classic installs place config.ini beside the exe (commonly under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Snipaste\\ or %APPDATA%\\Snipaste\\); Store edition uses LocalState. Both optional paths are captured. No credentials or sensitive data in scope. Confidence: medium - config.ini location varies by install type (portable vs installed vs Store); user may need to adjust paths for non-standard install locations. Authored secret warning: Snipaste config.ini does not store credentials or tokens; no secret paths identified. If a future version introduces license key storage in config.ini, review before restoring."
